2,'I Am Australian' with Pitjantjatjara lyrics | ABC 90 - YouTubePitjantjatjara - WikipediaKatrina Connelly - 'Wati Pitjantjarra' - Bush Bands Bash 2025Pitjantjatjara Spirituality: Australian Aboriginal Sacred ...Aboriginal Native Music - Pitjantjatjara Spirituality ...Isaac Yamma - Wikipedia,https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NTNgzcUnLas,"Jul 12, 2022 · Two languages, singing with one voice ️💛🖤💚💙 As Australians mark NAIDOC week, we wanted to share this beautiful performance of 'I Am Australian' with lyrics in Pitjantjatjara language. The Pitjantjatjara live mostly in the northwest of South Australia, extending across the border into the Northern Territory to just south of Lake Amadeus, and west a short distance into Western Australia. Dec 3, 2025 · She sings in both Pitjantjatjara and English about culture, family, and life on the Lands (Ngaanyatjarra ‘NG’ Lands). Whether on stage or behind the keys, her voice is soulful, strong, and... There are a total of 15 songs in Pitjantjatjara Spirituality: Australian Aboriginal Sacred Collection. The songs were composed by talented musicians such as Aboriginal Native Music, Native Aboriginal Guru, and Ethnic Style Sounds Group. Tracks 1 The Pitjantjatjara Tribe Aboriginal Native Music, Native Aboriginal Guru, Ethnic Style Sounds Group 2 Supernatural Beings Aboriginal Native Music, Native Aboriginal Guru, Ethnic Style Sounds Group 3 Dreaming Aboriginal Native Music, Native Aboriginal Guru, Ethnic Style Sounds Group 4 Sacred Didgeridoo He later performed with his band the Pitjantjatjara Country Band, a band made up of his sons Hector, Frank, Peter, and Paul, and his cousin Russell Yamma. His song were mostly sung in Pitjantjatjara. [citation needed]",Pitjantjatjara,Australian
